---
import SectionIntro from "../ui/SectionIntro.astro";
import FHat from "../ui/FHat.astro";
---

<section class="section-sm process">
  <div class="shell">
    <SectionIntro
      eyebrow="How TER represents a decision"
      title="Agents decide from the world they perceive."
      description="TER distinguishes what an agent knows and believes from reality itself, and the actions it perceives as feasible from those actually available. A decision can make sense from the agent's perspective and still produce an unexpected or failed outcome."
    />
    <div class="process-layout">
      <div class="ter-band row-1" data-reveal aria-hidden="true" style="--row-accent: var(--accent)">
        <div class="ter-band-head">
          <span class="ter-index">01</span>
          <span class="ter-band-label">Agent perception</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ter-nodes">
          <div class="ter-node">
            <strong>M</strong>
            <span>Model of reality</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ter-join" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          <div class="ter-node">
            <strong><FHat /></strong>
            <span>Perceived feasible actions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ter-band row-2" data-reveal aria-hidden="true" style="--row-accent: var(--violet)">
        <div class="ter-band-head">
          <span class="ter-index">02</span>
          <span class="ter-band-label">Selected action</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ter-nodes single">
          <div class="ter-node wide">
            <strong>C</strong>
            <span>Selected action</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ter-band row-3" data-reveal aria-hidden="true" style="--row-accent: var(--orange)">
        <div class="ter-band-head">
          <span class="ter-index">03</span>
          <span class="ter-band-label">Reality and outcome</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ter-nodes">
          <div class="ter-node">
            <strong>F</strong>
            <span>Actual feasible actions</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ter-join arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          <div class="ter-node">
            <strong>O</strong>
            <span>Realized outcome</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ol>
        <li class="row-1" data-reveal>
          <span>01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Agents interpret reality</h3>
            <p>
              Information and beliefs shape how an agent understands its options.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="row-2" data-reveal>
          <span>02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Agents select an action</h3>
            <p>
              The decision process selects from the actions the agent perceives as available.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="row-3" data-reveal>
          <span>03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Actions encounter reality</h3>
            <p>
            Reality determines what is actually feasible and what outcome follows.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .process {
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .process-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    align-items: stretch;
    column-gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    row-gap: 0;
    margin-top: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .row-1 { grid-row: 1; }
  .row-2 { grid-row: 2; }
  .row-3 { grid-row: 3; }

  ol {
    display: contents;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  li {
    grid-column: 2;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.15rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  li > span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  li p {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .ter-band {
    display: flex;
    grid-column: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    height: 100%;
    padding: 1.1rem 0 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .ter-band-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .ter-index {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ter-index::before {
    width: 0.4rem;
    height: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--row-accent, var(--accent));
    content: "";
  }

  .ter-band-label {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }

  .ter-nodes {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ter-node {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 4.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--row-accent, var(--line));
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ter-node:not(.wide) {
    flex: 1 1 0;
  }

  .ter-node.wide {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    min-height: 5rem;
  }

  .ter-node strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .ter-node.wide strong {
    font-size: 2.3rem;
  }

  .ter-node > span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.66rem;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

  .ter-join {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .process-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .row-1, .row-2, .row-3 {
      grid-row: auto;
    }
    .ter-band, li {
      grid-column: 1;
    }
    .ter-band {
      padding: 0.9rem 0 0.9rem 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
